,"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP"}]},"references":{"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"url":"\/documentation\/swami","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","kind":"symbol","title":"Swami","role":"collection"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/navigationDocument(_:preview:)-8reoi":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/navigationdocument(_:preview:)-8reoi","type":"topic","title":"navigationDocument(_:preview:)","abstract":[],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/navigationDocument(_:preview:)-8reoi","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"navigationDocument"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"D"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"I"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"D"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"preview"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SharePreview","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI12SharePreviewV"},{